Z||000000||ichifiero||07-11-2001||11:44 PM||||I have an '85 SE with an auto. I have an opportunity to buy a cadillac with the 4.5L V8 and 4 speed auto trans with low mile for cheap. I have not heard of anyone doing a conversion with this power package. I am also thinking of putting in the 4 spped auto trans. Am I out of my mind, or is this reasonable?????<BR>Thanks.||||reg||1
